# SolNeutral V7.2 • Vercel Root Directory: frontend
# Add values in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# Browser/public, TEST ASSETS ONLY:
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEVNET_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_DEVNET_TRADING=true

# Recommended: separate read-only MAINNET RPC for market research (optional public fallback):
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://your-mainnet-rpc-provider.example/KEY

# Private Claude AI Analyst integration. Set values in Vercel UI (never commit keys).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_CLAUDE_API_KEY
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# AI_DEMO_ACCESS_TOKEN=YOUR_RANDOM_PRIVATE_SECRET_AT_LEAST_20_CHARACTERS

# No Railway/Flask URL required. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is not used by current V7.
# SOL/USD spot reference price API: /api/market/sol-chart — uses Coinbase Exchange
# public OHLCV candles, no additional key required. This is not Drift devnet perp pricing.
# Never commit wallet private keys, seed phrases, real .env files, or API tokens.

# Vercel: add variables under Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# Select Production, then redeploy for changes to become active.
# Legacy RAILWAY_* or NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL settings are not used by V7.1.

# NOTE: NEVER switch devnet execution to testnet merely by changing RPC URLs:
# Drift market/program state and the wallet assets are cluster-specific.
# SolNeutral V7.2 remains devnet-only for wallet-signed execution.
